+# Three-pillar refresh plan
+
+Baseline: d66d1c9e07e76bc0b47c0a1217ee8c118d890948 (GitHub main).
+
+Inspection found five competing navigation categories, a town-led homepage, disconnected advertising and technology sections, a generic link collection, unnecessary homepage scripts, an automatic feedback invitation, and unused earlier homepage CSS. The current business dataset is empty. Product fabric, minimum orders and dispatch specifications are unverified and must not be invented.
+
+1. Make lungis the primary homepage and navigation focus.
+2. Rebuild English and Tamil homepages in this order: lungi hero, collection, enquiry, weaving story, buyer clarity, Explore Podaturpet, technology/collaboration, contact.
+3. Consolidate navigation into three pillars; retain useful town pages, regional attractions, tools, product details and existing redirects.
+4. Use actual product photographs; show a transparent local advertising invitation instead of invented advertisers or endorsements.
+5. Remove verified unused code and homepage-only dependencies. Preserve shared scripts used by other pages.
+6. Validate URLs, fragments, duplicate IDs, SEO signals, source syntax and patch application. Attempt visual and interaction verification; document any environment limitations.
