<br><em>A professional impression.</em></h1><p>Add your details, check the preview, then print or save as PDF. Your invoice carries only the business details you enter.</p><p lang="ta">உங்கள் பெயர், logo சேர்த்து invoice உருவாக்குங்கள். மூன்று முறை இலவசமாக Print / PDF முயற்சி செய்யலாம்.</p></section><div class="trial"><div><strong id="trial-status" role="status">Checking trial availability…</strong><p>Each Print / PDF request uses one trial, even if you cancel the print dialog. The trial is tracked in this browser.</p></div><a id="contact" href="https://wa.me/14793201970?text=Hello%2C%20I%20have%20tried%20the%20invoice%20maker%20and%20would%20like%20permanent%20access.%20Please%20share%20the%20details.">Need permanent access? Contact us →</a></div><div id="error" class="error" role="alert" hidden></div><noscript>This invoice tool needs JavaScript enabled.</noscript><div class="workspace"><form id="invoice-form"><section class="panel"><h2>01 · Your business</h2><label>Business name <input name="business" required maxlength="120" placeholder="Your business name" autocomplete="organization"></label><label>Address / contact details <textarea name="businessDetails" maxlength="600" rows="3" placeholder="Address, phone, email"></textarea></label><div class="two"><label>Logo (optional, PNG / JPEG / WebP, max 2 MB)<input type="file" id="logo" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp"></label><label>Accent colour<input type="color" name="accent" value="#164d42"></label></div><button type="button" id="remove-logo" class="quiet">Remove logo</button></section><section class="panel"><h2>02 · Invoice &amp; customer</h2><div class="two"><label>Invoice number<input name="number" required maxlength="60" value="INV-001"></label><label>Currency<select name="currency"><option value="INR">INR — Indian Rupee</option><option value="USD">USD — US Dollar</option><option value="GBP">GBP — Pound Sterling</option><option value="EUR">EUR — Euro</option><option value="CAD">CAD — Canadian Dollar</option><option value="AED">AED — UAE Dirham</option></select></label><label>Invoice date<input name="date" type="date" required></label><label>Due date (optional)<input name="due" type="date"></label></div><label>Customer name<input name="customer" required maxlength="120" placeholder="Customer or company"></label><label>Customer address / contact<textarea name="customerDetails" maxlength="600" rows="3"></textarea></label></section><section class="panel"><h2>03 · Items &amp; amounts</h2><div id="items"></div><button type="button" id="add-item" class="quiet">+ Add item</button><div class="two adjustments"><label>Discount amount<input name="discount" type="number" min="0" max="100000000" step="0.01" value="0"></label><label>Tax rate (%)<input name="tax" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" value="0"></label></div><p class="hint">Tax is applied after the discount. This is a general invoice template; enter the rates and details appropriate for your business.</p><label>Notes / payment instructions<textarea name="notes" maxlength="1500" rows="3" placeholder="Payment instructions, reference or thank-you note"></textarea></label></section><div class="actions"><button id="export" type="submit" disabled>Print / Save as PDF</button><button type="button" id="clear" class="quiet">Clear invoice</button></div><p class="hint">Choose “Save as PDF” in your browser’s print dialog. Turn off browser headers and footers for a clean invoice. Invoice text and logo stay in this page; they are not sent to us or saved as a draft. Reloading clears your entries.</p></form><aside class="preview-wrap"><div class="preview-label">LIVE PREVIEW <span>No platform branding</span></div><div id="preview" class="invoice"></div></aside></div></main><footer class="site-footer" data-site-footer="true"><!-- PT:shared:footer:START --><div class="site-footer-inner"><div class="site-footer-intro"><a class="site-brand" href="/">PODATURPET</a><p><span data-site-en="Rooted in Tamil Nadu. Open to the world." d