optional)<input name="due" type="date"></label></div><label>Customer name<input name="customer" required maxlength="120" placeholder="Customer or company"></label><label>Customer address / contact<textarea name="customerDetails" maxlength="600" rows="3"></textarea></label></section><section class="panel"><h2>03 · Items &amp; amounts</h2><div id="items"></div><button type="button" id="add-item" class="quiet">+ Add item</button><div class="two adjustments"><label>Discount amount<input name="discount" type="number" min="0" max="100000000" step="0.01" value="0"></label><label>Tax rate (%)<input name="tax" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" value="0"></label></div><p class="hint">Tax is applied after the discount. This is a general invoice template; enter the rates and details appropriate for your business.</p><label>Notes / payment instructions<textarea name="notes" maxlength="1500" rows="3" placeholder="Payment instructions, reference or thank-you note"></textarea></label></section><div class="actions"><button id="export" type="submit" disabled>Print / Save as PDF</button><button type="button" id="clear" class="quiet">Clear invoice</button></div><p class="hint">Choose “Save as PDF” in your browser’s print dialog. Turn off browser headers and footers for a clean invoice. Invoice text and logo stay in this page; they are not sent to us or saved as a draft. Reloading clears your entries.</p></form><aside class="preview-wrap"><div class="preview-label">LIVE PREVIEW <span>No platform branding</span></div><div id="preview" class="invoice"></div></aside></div></main><footer class="site-footer" data-site-footer="true"><!-- PT:shared:footer:START --><div class="site-footer-inner"><div class="site-footer-intro"><a class="site-brand" href="/">PODATURPET</a><p><span data-site-en="Rooted in Tamil Nadu. Open to the world." data-site-ta="தமிழ்நாட்டில் வேரூன்றி, உலகுடன் இணைகிறோம்.">Rooted in Tamil Nadu. Open to the world.</span></p></div><nav aria-label="Explore Podaturpet"><