     <section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div><div class="kicker" lang="en">Modern Lungi product concepts · 2026</div><h1>Traditional comfort. <em lang="en">Modern function.</em></h1><p class="lead"><strong lang="en">Modern Lungi</strong> is an exploratory convertible-lungi direction designed to retain woven identity while making fit, movement, storage and climate use easier for a wider global audience.</p><p class="tamil" lang="ta"><strong>நவீன லுங்கி:</strong> பாரம்பரிய அழகை பாதுகாத்து, இன்றைய வாழ்க்கைக்கு ஏற்ற வகையில் ஒரே லுங்கியை ஐந்து விதமாகப் பயன்படுத்தும் புதிய தயாரிப்பு யோசனை.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#five-modes" lang="en">Explore the concepts</a><a class="button alt" href="/modern-lungi-global-collection.html" lang="en">View the visual collection</a></div></div><div class="hero-image"><img src="images/modern-lungi/modern-lungi-reversible.webp" alt="Modern Lungi long and short wearing mode concept" width="1500" height="1000" decoding="async"><div class="hero-badge" lang="en">Original exploratory concept</div></div></div></section>
     <section id="five-modes"><div class="container"><div class="head"><div class="kicker" lang="en">Core product direction</div><h2 lang="en">Modern Lungi: five modes in one adaptable garment.</h2><p lang="en">The wearer chooses the mode that suits the moment, instead of needing a completely different garment.</p></div><div class="modes"><article class="mode"><small lang="en">MODE 01</small><h3 lang="en">Classic</h3><p lang="en">Traditional full-length drape for familiar comfort.</p></article><article class="mode"><small lang="en">MODE 02</small><h3 lang="en">City</h3><p lang="en">Secure snap closure for walking and daily movement.</p></article><article class="mode"><small lang="en">MODE 03</small><h3 lang="en">Active</h3><p lang="en">Fold-and-fasten knee length with optional inner coverage.</p></article><article class="mode"><small lang="en">MODE 04</small><h3 lang="en">Travel</h3><p lang="en">Protected phone, passport and key storage.</p></article><article class="mode"><small lang="en">MODE 05</small><h3 lang="en">Cold Climate</h3><p lang="en">Optional removable lining for layered winter styling.</p></article></div></div></section>
     <section class="feature-section"><div class="container feature-layout"><img src="images/modern-lungi/modern-lungi-feature-details.webp" alt="Adjustable waist, snap, zipper pocket and inner short concepts" loading="lazy" width="1312" height="1199" decoding="async"><div><div class="head"><div class="kicker" lang="en">Functional foundation</div><h2 lang="en">Designed around confidence, not novelty alone.</h2><p lang="en">The strongest first prototype combines a small number of features that solve real customer concerns.</p></div><div class="feature-list"><div class="feature"><b lang="en">FitLock waist</b><span lang="en">Soft adjustment with side buckle and secure snaps.</span></div><div class="feature"><b lang="en">Supported pockets</b><span lang="en">Zipped storage designed to reduce pulling at the waist.</span></div><div class="feature"><b lang="en">Optional inner shorts</b><span lang="en">Detachable coverage for active and public use.</span></div><div class="feature"><b lang="en">Length conversion</b><span lang="en">Hidden fasteners switch full length to knee length.</span></div></div></div></div></section>
@@ -43,8 +43,8 @@
     <section class="prototype-section" id="prototypes"><div class="container"><div class="head"><div class="kicker" lang="en">Start focused</div><h2 lang="en">Three prototypes to test first.</h2><p lang="en">Instead of placing every feature in one product, these three focused versions can reveal what customers genuinely value.</p></div><div class="prototype-grid"><article class="prototype"><img src="images/modern-lungi/modern-lungi-resort.webp" alt="Modern Lungi Air warm weather concept" loading="lazy" width="1500" height="1000" decoding="async"><div class="prototype-copy"><h3 lang="en">Modern Lungi Air</h3><p lang="en">A lightweight warm-weather version for home, resort and summer use.</p><ul><li lang="en">Breathable woven fabric</li><li lang="en">FitLock waist</li><li lang="en">One secure pocket</li></ul></div></article><article class="prototype"><img src="images/modern-lungi/modern-lungi-airport-travel.webp" alt="Modern Lungi Travel concept" loading="lazy" width="1500" height="1000" decoding="async"><div class="prototype-copy"><h3 lang="en">Modern Lungi Travel</h3><p lang="en">A secure, packable version for airports, road trips and leisure.</p><ul><li lang="en">Passport and phone pockets</li><li lang="en">Snap closure</li><li lang="en">Optional inner shorts</li></ul></div></article><article class="prototype"><img src="images/modern-lungi/modern-lungi-winter-style.webp" alt="Modern Lungi Winter cold climate concept" loading="lazy" width="1500" height="1000" decoding="async"><div class="prototype-copy"><h3 lang="en">Modern Lungi Winter</h3><p lang="en">A layered concept for customers in colder markets.</p><ul><li lang="en">Removable thermal layer</li><li lang="en">Legging-compatible fit</li><li lang="en">Heavier seasonal check</li></ul></div></article></div></div></section>
     <section class="validation" id="feedback"><div class="container validation-grid"><div><div class="head"><div class="kicker" lang="en">Research before production</div><h2 lang="en">What should be tested?</h2><p lang="en">A good idea becomes a real product only after practical customer and manufacturing validation.</p></div><div class="test-list"><div><b lang="en">Fit and movement</b><span lang="en">Walking, sitting, stairs and active conversion.</span></div><div><b lang="en">Pocket load</b><span lang="en">Phone and passport security without waist sag.</span></div><div><b lang="en">Wash performance</b><span lang="en">Shrinkage, colour fastness, closures and lining durability.</span></div><div><b lang="en">Market acceptance</b><span lang="en">Style preference, price expectations and how-to-wear confidence.</span></div></div></div><div class="cta-card"><div class="kicker" lang="en">Customer · retailer · collaborator</div><h2 lang="en">Which prototype should we develop first?</h2><p lang="en">Share your country, preferred prototype, use case and the feature that matters most to you.</p><a class="button" href="https://wa.me/14793201970?text=Hello%20Podaturpet%20Team%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20share%20feedback%20on%20the%20Modern%20Lungi%20innovation%20concepts.%0ACountry%3A%20____%0APreferred%20prototype%3A%20Air%20%2F%20Travel%20%2F%20Winter%0AMost%20important%20feature%3A%20____%0AComments%3A%20____" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" lang="en">Send product feedback</a><a class="button alt" href="/modern-lungi-investors-research-partners.html" lang="en">Investor or research partnership</a><p class="notice" lang="en">These Modern Lungi visuals and features are exploratory concepts. Final specifications, feasibility, availability, price and intellectual-property status must be confirmed before commercial use.</p></div></div></section>
