 <main id="main"><section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">PODATURPET · EVERYDAY KNOWLEDGE</p><h1>People Information Hub</h1><p class="hero-title">Tamil Life Assistant</p><p class="hero-intro">Ask. Understand. Take the next step.</p><p class="hero-intro">Practical guides, plain-language answers and official places to check. For life in Tamil Nadu, India and beyond.</p><p class="independent">Independent guide · Free to use · No login</p></div><aside class="today-card"><span class="today-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><h2>Today, where you are</h2><time id="today-date">From your device clock. Not a live event or holiday feed.</time><label for="time-zone" class="js-control" hidden>Calendar time zone</label><select id="time-zone" class="js-control" hidden><option value="device">This device’s time zone</option><option value="Asia/Kolkata">India · Asia/Kolkata</option><option value="America/New_York">New York</option><option value="America/Chicago">Chicago</option><option value="America/Los_Angeles">Los Angeles</option><option value="Europe/London">London</option><option value="Asia/Singapore">Singapore</option><option value="Australia/Sydney">Sydney</option><option value="UTC">UTC</option></select><p class="clock-note">From your device clock. Not a live event or holiday feed.</p><a href="#category-today">Find official calendars →</a><div class="today-bottom"><strong>Before you act</strong><p>Check the original notice. Match the year and region. Look for a later correction.</p></div></aside></section>
