 <section class="life-tools js-control" id="life-calculators" hidden><p class="eyebrow">02 / Plan with your own numbers</p><h2>Plan with your own numbers</h2><p>No live prices or exchange rates. Amounts are not saved or sent. Estimates only; confirm all costs with the institution or provider.</p><div class="life-tool-grid"><details id="life-education"><summary>Education funding plan</summary><form id="education-form" class="life-form" novalidate><label>Currency for all amounts<select name="currency"><option>INR</option><option>USD</option><option>GBP</option><option>EUR</option><option>CAD</option><option>AUD</option><option>SGD</option><option>AED</option><option>MYR</option><option>LKR</option></select></label><label>Total tuition for the course<input name="tuition" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" max="100000000" step="0.01" required autocomplete="off"></label><label>Monthly living cost<input name="monthly" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" max="100000000" step="0.01" required autocomplete="off"></label><label>Months of study (1–120)<input name="study" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="1" max="120" step="1" required autocomplete="off"></label><label>Other one-off costs<input name="other" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" max="100000000" step="0.01" required autocomplete="off"></label><label>Confirmed savings and funding<input name="funding" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" max="100000000" step="0.01" required autocomplete="off"></label><label>Months available to save (1–120)<input name="save" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="1" max="120" step="1" required autocomplete="off"></label><button>Calculate</button><p class="life-result" id="education-result" role="status"></p></form><p>Total = tuition + monthly living × study months + other costs. Gap = total minus confirmed funding, minimum zero. Monthly target = gap ÷ saving months, rounded up to a cent. No interest, inflation or unconfirmed scholarship included.</p><a href="#guide-education-cost">Understand → official action ↗</a></details><details id="life-remittance"><summary>Compare two money-transfer quotes</summary><form id="remittance-form" class="life-form" novalidate><label>Sending currency<select name="sender"><option>INR</option><option>USD</option><option>GBP</option><option>EUR</option><option>CAD</option><option>AUD</option><option>SGD</option><option>AED</option><option>MYR</option><option>LKR</option></select></label><label>Receiving currency<select name="receiver"><option>INR</option><option>USD</option><option>GBP</option><option>EUR</option><option>CAD</option><option>AUD</option><option>SGD</option><option>AED</option><option>MYR</option><option>LKR</option></select></label><label>Total amount you will spend (including sending fee)<input name="budget" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" max="100000000" step="0.01" required autocomplete="off"></label><fieldset><legend>Quote A</legend><label>Sending fee (sending currency)<input name="afee" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" max="100000000" step="0.01" required autocomplete="off"></label><label>Quoted rate: receiving units for 1 sending unit<input name="arate" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0.000001" max="100000" step="0.000001" required autocomplete="off"></label><label>Other recipient deductions (receiving currency)<input name="adeduction" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" max="100000000" step="0.01" required autocomplete="off"></label></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Quote B</legend><label>Sending fee (sending currency)<input name="bfee" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" max="100000000" step="0.01" required autocomplete="off"></label><label>Quoted rate: receiving units for 1 sending unit<input name="brate" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0.000001" max="100000" step="0.000001" required autocomplete="off"></label><label>Other recipient deductions (receiving currency)<input name="bdeduction" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" max="100000000" step="0.01" required autocomplete="off"></label></fieldset><button>Calculate</button><p class="life-result" id="remittance-result" role="status"></p></form><p>Received = (budget − sending fee) × quoted rate − recipient deductions. Compare quotes for the same time, payment method and delivery method. This does not rank providers or include undisclosed charges. Refresh quotes before sending money.</p><a href="#guide-remittance-quotes">Understand → official action ↗</a></details></div></section>
