 <p class="region-label">General / worldwide</p><h3 id="title-remittance-quotes" tabindex="-1">Compare two money-transfer quotes</h3><p class="summary">Compare the same total sending budget and the amount expected to reach the recipient.</p>
 <details><summary>Read the guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></summary><div class="guide-body"><h4>Your next steps</h4><ol><li>Obtain both quotes at roughly the same time for the same sending and receiving currencies.</li><li>Include sending fees and any known receiving-side deduction. Enter each quoted rate yourself.</li><li>Check delivery time, provider terms and any missing charges before deciding.</li></ol><p class="caution">No live rate, transfer service or provider recommendation. Results use only your inputs and can differ from the final transaction.</p><h4>Official sources</h4><ul class="sources"><li><a href="https://remittanceprices.worldbank.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer external">World Bank Remittance Prices Worldwide ↗</a><small class="source-domain">remittanceprices.worldbank.org</small><small class="review" data-reviewed="2026-09-19">Source review: <time datetime="2026-09-19">2026-09-19</time> · Directory purpose checked</small></li><li><a href="https://www.consumerfinance.gov/consumer-tools/sending-money/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer external">CFPB — Sending money ↗</a><small class="source-domain">www.consumerfinance.gov</small><small class="review" data-reviewed="2026-09-19">Source review: <time datetime="2026-09-19">2026-09-19</time> · Directory purpose checked</small></li></ul><div class="guide-actions js-control" hidden><button type="button" data-print="remittance-quotes">Print this guide / Save PDF</button><button type="button" data-copy="remittance-quotes">Copy guide link</button></div><a class="permalink" href="/people-information-hub.html#guide-remittance-quotes">Permanent link ↗</a></div></details></article></div><p class="print-hint">Use your browser’s print dialog to save as PDF. No file is uploaded.</p></section>
