     <section class="hero"><div><div class="eyebrow" lang="en">For local textile businesses</div><h1>Your weaving story deserves <span lang="en">to be discovered.</span></h1><p class="lead" lang="en">If you operate a textile, weaving or lungi-supply business connected with the Podaturpet region, tell us about your work and start a conversation about a possible sourcing or listing opportunity.</p></div><img class="hero-photo" src="images/lungi-patterns.jpeg" alt="Original photograph of traditional checked lungi designs associated with Podaturpet textile sourcing" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="1332" height="1178" srcset="/images/responsive/lungi-patterns-480.webp 480w, /images/responsive/lungi-patterns-800.webp 800w, /images/responsive/lungi-patterns-1200.webp 1200w, /images/lungi-patterns.jpeg 1332w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 92vw, (max-width: 1000px) 50vw, 560px"></section>
     <section class="section"><h2 lang="en">Who can introduce their business?</h2><div class="cards"><article class="card"><h3 lang="en">Weavers and textile producers</h3><p lang="en">Share the products, techniques and sourcing capabilities your actual business can support.</p></article><article class="card"><h3 lang="en">Lungi suppliers and wholesalers</h3><p lang="en">Explain your product categories, service area and the type of buyer enquiries you welcome.</p></article><article class="card"><h3 lang="en">Related local businesses</h3><p lang="en">Tell us about textile trading, finishing, packing or other genuine local business activities.</p></article></div></section>
     <section class="section" id="supplier-enquiry"><div class="enquiry"><div><div class="eyebrow" lang="en">Start with accurate details</div><h2 lang="en">Introduce your business.</h2><p lang="en">For a supplier introduction or advertising enquiry, share your business location, product range and photographs you have permission to publish. Tell us whether you want a business listing, a product promotion or a buyer introduction. We will discuss placement, timing and any charges before publication.</p><p class="lead" lang="en">This form prepares a WhatsApp message. It does not create a public listing or guarantee approval, verification or customer enquiries.</p></div><form class="form" id="supplier-enquiry-form"><label class="field">Business name<input name="business_name" placeholder="Your actual business name" required></label><label class="field">Business type<select name="business_type" required><option value="" lang="en">Select your activity</option><option lang="en">Handloom weaving</option><option lang="en">Powerloom weaving</option><option lang="en">Lungi supplier or wholesaler</option><option lang="en">Textile trading</option><option lang="en">Other local business</option></select></label><label class="field">Business location<input name="location" placeholder="Town or operating area" required></label><label class="field">Products or services<input name="products" placeholder="For example: checked lungi designs" required></label><label class="field full">Additional details <span style="font-weight:500;color:#65746c" data-site-en="(optional)" data-site-ta="(விருப்பம்)">(optional)</span><textarea name="details" placeholder="Products, business background or questions about a possible listing"></textarea></label><button class="submit" type="submit" lang="en">Send Business Introduction on WhatsApp</button><p class="note" lang="en">Your information is shared only when you choose to send the WhatsApp message. A future listing would require accurate business details and a separate review.</p></form></div></section>
     <section class="section"><h2 lang="en">Better connections start with honest information.</h2><div class="principles"><ul><li lang="en">Describe your actual products, business location and sourcing capabilities.</li><li lang="en">Do not claim certification, verification or manufacturing status without evidence.</li><li lang="en">Confirm product specifications, samples and commercial terms directly with buyers.</li><li lang="en">Understand that an enquiry is a first conversation, not a guaranteed listing or order.</li></ul></div><div class="related"><a href="/lungi-product-catalogue.html" lang="en">Explore photographed lungi designs →</a><a href="/podaturpet-weaving-textiles.html" lang="en">Read about Podaturpet weaving →</a></div></section>
