ass="eyebrow"><span data-i18n="free">ALWAYS FREE · NO LOGIN</span></p><h1><span data-i18n="title">US ↔ India Family Travel Planner</span></h1><p class="lead"><span data-i18n="lead">Less last-minute worry. More time with family.</span></p><p><span data-i18n="intro">One calm place for documents, packing, parents’ travel and the little things you do not want to forget.</span></p></div><div class="route-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="route-top"><span>USA</span><svg viewbox="0 0 100 40" width="120" height="48"><path d="M5 32 Q50 -15 95 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4 5"></path><path d="M42 20 L58 11 L55 22 L50 19 L45 24 Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><span>INDIA</span></div><div class="route-bottom"><span>FAMILY FIRST</span><strong>வணக்கம்.</strong><span>HOME IS CLOSER.</span></div></div></section><div class="toolbar"><button id="save" class="primary"><span data-i18n="save">Save on this device</span></button><button id="load"><span data-i18n="load">Load saved plan</span></button><button id="print-plan"><span data-i18n="print">Print / Save PDF</span></button><span id="save-status" role="status"></span></div><p class="privacy-line"><span data-i18n="privacyShort">Private by design: this planner sends no form data to analytics. Save only on a device you trust.</span></p><div id="message" role="status" hidden></div><noscript>Enable JavaScript to use this planner. / இந்தக் கருவிக்கு JavaScript தேவை.</noscript><div class="dashboard"><div><span><span data-i18n="countdown">DEPARTURE</span></span><strong id="countdown">—</strong></div><div><span><span data-i18n="progress">CHECKLIST COMPLETE</span></span><strong id="progress-text">0 / 0</strong><progress id="progress-bar" value="0" max="1" aria-label="Checklist progress"></progress></div><div><span><span data-i18n="focus">NEXT STEP</span></span><strong id="next-step"></strong></div></div><nav class="planner-nav" aria-label="Planner sections / திட்டப் பகுதிகள்"><button type="button" data-panel="trip" aria-controls="panel-trip" aria-pressed="true"><span data-i18n="navtrip">01 · Trip &amp; documents</span></button><button type="button" data-panel="checklist" aria-controls="panel-checklist" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i18n="navchecklist">02 · Checklist</span></button><button type="button" data-panel="lists" aria-controls="panel-lists" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i18n="navlists">03 · Packing &amp; lists</span></button><button type="button" data-panel="emergency" aria-controls="panel-emergency" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i18n="navemergency">04 · Emergency card</span></button><button type="button" data-panel="privacy" aria-controls="panel-privacy" aria-pressed="false"><span data-i18n="navprivacy">05 · Save &amp; guidance</span></button></nav><section class="panel" id="panel-trip" aria-labelledby="trip-heading"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span data-i18n="begin">START HERE</span></p><h2 id="trip-heading" tabindex="-1"><span data-i18n="tripHeading">Make it your journey</span></h2></div><span class="pill"><span data-i18n="datesNote">Dates only. No document numbers.</span></span></div><div class="form-grid"><label class="field" for="trip-direction"><span data-i18n="direction">Travel direction</span><select id="trip-direction" data-group="trip" data-field="direction"><option value="us-in" data-i18n="toIndia">USA → India</option><option value="in-us" data-i18n="toUSA">India → USA</option></select></label><label class="field" for="trip-label"><span data-i18n="label">Trip nickname (optional)</span><input id="trip-label" type="text" data-group="trip" data-field="label" maxlength="120"></label><label class="field" for="trip-from"><span data-i18n="from">Departure city / airport</span><input id="trip-from" type="text" data-group="trip" data-field="from" maxlength="120"></label><label class="field" for="trip-to"><span data-i18n="to">Destination city / airport</span><input id="trip-to" type="text" data-group="trip" data-field="to" maxlength="120"></label><label class="field" for="trip-departure"><span data-i18n="departure">Departure date</span><input id="trip-departure" type="date" data-group="trip" data-field="departure"></label><label class="field" for="trip-arrival"><span data-i18n="arrival">Arrival date at destination</span><input id="trip-arrival" type="date" data-group="trip" data-field="arrival"></label><label class="field" for="trip-returnDate"><span data-i18n="returnDate">Planned return / destination exit date</span><input id="trip-returnDate" type="date" data-group="trip" data-field="returnDate"></label></div><label class="check-row"><input id="trip-parents" type="checkbox" data-group="trip" data-field="parents"><span data-i18n="parents">Include extra support for parents / older travelers</span></label><p class="hint"><span data-i18n="calendar">Use local calendar dates from your itinerary. Reminders use today’s date on this device; no notifications are sent when this page is closed.</span></p><div id="date-errors" role="alert"></div><div class="subhead"><h3><span data-i18n="travelers">Family document reminders</span></h3><button id="add-traveler"><span data-i18n="addTraveler">+ Add traveler</span></button></div><p class="hint"><span data-i18n="docNote">Use a nickname such as Amma or Appa. Never enter passport numbers, visa numbers, dates of birth or document scans. A six-month reminder is a planning prompt, not a universal entry rule.</span></p><div id="travelers"></div><div id="document-alerts"></div><p class="notice"><span data-i18n="visaStay">For US visitors, visa expiry and authorized stay are different. Check the official I-94 record after arrival. Never treat this planner as permission to enter or remain.</span> <a href="https://www.usa.gov/arrival-departure-record" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">I-94 ↗</a></p></section><section class="panel" id="panel-checklist" aria-labelledby="checklist-heading" hidden><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="checklist-heading" tabindex="-1"><span data-i18n="checkHeading">A little preparation, at the right time</span></h2><label class="check-row"><input id="due-only" type="checkbox"><span data-i18n="dueOnly">Show due / overdue only</span></label></div><p class="hint"><span data-i18n="checkNote">Start document preparation earlier if needed. These suggested dates are not government deadlines. Tick tasks as you finish them.</span></p><div id="checklist"></div></section><section class="panel" id="panel-lists" aria-labelledby="lists-heading" hidden><h2 id="lists-heading" tabindex="-1"><span data-i18n="listsHeading">Everything in its place</span></h2><p class="hint"><span data-i18n="bagNote">These are planning suggestions, not permission to carry an item. Check your airline, transit country and destination rules.</span></p><div class="subhead"><h3><span data-i18n="packing">Packing list</span></h3></div><form id="add-packing" class="inline-form"><label class="field"><span data-i18n="packItem">Item</span><input name="item" required maxlength="200"></label><label class="field"><span data-i18n="bag">Bag</span><select name="bag"><option value="personal" data-i18n="personal">Personal item</option><option value="carry" data-i18n="carry">Carry-on</option><option value="checked" data-i18n="checked">Checked bag</option></select></label><button type="submit"><span data-i18n="add">+ Add</span></button></form><div id="packing"></div><div class="subhead"><h3><span data-i18n="medicines">Medicine list</span></h3><button id="add-medicine"><span data-i18n="addMedicine">+ Add medicine</span></button></div><p class="notice"><span data-i18n="medicineNote">Record your own prescribed instructions only. Ask a clinician about doses, time-zone changes and storage. Check import rules; this tool does not recommend medicines or doses.</span> <a href="https://wwwnc.cdc.gov/travel/page/travel-abroad-with-medicine" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CDC ↗</a></p><div id="medicine"></div><div class="subhead"><h3><span data-i18n="gifts">Gift list</span></h3><button id="add-gift"><span data-i18n="addGift">+ Add gift</span></button></div><p class="hint"><span data-i18n="giftNote">Check customs restrictions and declarations before packing gifts or food.</span></p><div id="gifts"></div></section><section class="panel" id="panel-emergency" aria-labelledby="emergency-heading" hidden><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="emergency-heading" tabindex="-1"><span data-i18n="cardHeading">A little card. A lot of reassurance.</span></h2><button id="print-card" class="primary"><span data-i18n="printCard">Print emergency card</span></button></div><p><span data-i18n="cardNote">Fill only details you are comfortable carrying on paper. The card prints in both languages. Store it securely.</span></p><div class="card-layout"><div class="form-grid"><label class="field" for="card-name"><span data-i18n="name">Traveler nickname</span><input id="card-name" type="text" data-group="card" data-field="name" maxlength="120"></label><label class="field" for="card-phone"><span data-i18n="phone">Traveler phone with country code</span><input id="card-phone" type="text" data-group="card" data-field="phone" maxlength="120"></label><label class="field" for="card-host"><span data-i18n="host">Host / family contact name</span><input id="card-host" type="text" data-group="card" data-field="host" maxlength="120"></label><label class="field" for="card-hostPhone"><span data-i18n="hostPhone">Host phone with country code</span><input id="card-hostPhone" type="text" data-group="card" data-field="hostPhone" maxlength="120"></label><label class="field" for="card-address"><span data-i18n="address">Destination address</span><textarea id="card-address" data-group="card" data-field="address" maxlength="500" rows="3"></textarea></label><label class="field" for="card-backup"><span data-i18n="backup">Backup contact and phone</span><input id="card-backup" type="text" data-group="card" data-field="backup" maxlength="120"></label><label class="field" for="card-help"><span data-i18n="help">Assistance note (optional)</span><textarea id="card-help" data-group="card" data-field="help" maxlength="500" rows="3"></textarea></label></div><div id="emergency-preview"></div></div></section><section class="panel" id="panel-privacy" aria-labelledby="privacy-heading" hidden><h2 id="privacy-heading" tabindex="-1"><span data-i18n="saveHeading">Your plan stays with you</span></h2><p><span data-i18n="storageNote">Save keeps one plan in this browser on this device. It is not encrypted and does not sync. Other people using this browser, extensions or other same-site scripts may be able to access it. Use a trusted device, avoid private details and delete the saved copy after your trip.</span></p><p><span data-i18n="noNetwork">The planner has no ads, trackers, login, uploads or network requests from your entries. Existing website pages keep their usual analytics and ads. Opening an official-source link leaves this planner; those sites have their own privacy policies. Hosting providers may log ordinary page requests.</span></p><div class="backup-box"><h3><span data-i18n="backupHeading">Keep a backup you control</span></h3><p><span data-i18n="backupNote">Downloaded JSON and PDFs contain what you entered. They are not encrypted. Share them only with people you trust. Browser data clearing may erase the saved plan.</span></p><div class="button-row"><button id="export-json"><span data-i18n="export">Download backup (JSON)</span></button><label class="file-button" for="import-json"><span data-i18n="import">Import backup</span><input id="import-json" type="file" accept=".json,application/json"></label><button id="delete-saved" class="danger-button"><span data-i18n="deleteSaved">Delete saved copy</span></button><button id="new-plan"><span data-i18n="newPlan">New blank plan</span></button></div></div><h3><span data-i18n="sourcesHeading">Official information, always worth rechecking</span></h3><p><span data-i18n="sourceNote">Rules change. Check government guidance, your airline and transit requirements before booking and again before departure. Link review: 19 September 2026.</span></p><div id="sources"></div><div class="notice"><h3><span data-i18n="disclaimer">Planning aid, not official advice</span></h3><p><span data-i18n="disclaimerText">This free planner is not affiliated with an airline or government. It does not decide visa eligibility, passport validity requirements, admission, permitted stay, customs clearance or medical treatment. Date flags are reminders, not legal or medical conclusions. Verify with the relevant authority and qualified professionals. No eligibility or safe-travel guarantee is made.</span></p></div></section></main><footer class="site-footer" data-site-footer="true"><!-- PT:shared:footer:START --><div class="site-footer-inner"><div class="site-footer-intro"><a class="site-brand" href="/">PODATURPET</a><p><span data-site-en="Rooted in Tamil Nadu. Open to the world." data-site-ta="தமிழ்நாட்டில் வேரூன்றி, உலகுடன் இணைகிறோம்.">Rooted in Tamil Nadu. Open to the world.</span></p></div><nav aria-label="Explore Podaturpet"><a href="/lungi-product-catalogue.html"><span data-site-en="Lungis &amp; textiles" data-site-ta="லுங்கி · நெசவு">Lungis &amp; textiles</span></a><a href="/podaturpet-town-guide.html"><span data-site-en="Explore Podaturpet" data-site-ta="நம்ம ஊரை அறிய">Explore Podaturpet</span></a><a href="/business-website-development.html"><span data-site-en="Technology &amp; collaboration" data-site-ta="தொழில்நுட்பம் · கூட்டாண்மை">Technology &amp; collaboration</span></a></nav><nav aria-label="Tools and contact"><a href="/podaturpet-local-business-directory.html"><span data-site-en="Shops &amp; services" data-site-ta="கடைகள் · சேவைகள்">Shops &amp; services</span></a><a href="/advertise-on-podaturpet.html"><span data-site-en="Local advertising" data-site-ta="உள்ளூர் விளம்பரம்">Local advertising</span></a><a href="/free-invoice.html"><span data-site-en="Invoice maker · 3 trial exports" data-site-ta="இன்வாய்ஸ் · 3 இலவச முயற்சிகள்">Invoice maker · 3 trial exports</span></a><a href="/us-india-family-travel-planner.html"><span data-site-en="Free family travel planner" data-site-ta="இலவச குடும்பப் பயணத் திட்டம்">Free family travel planner</span></a><a href="/#contact"><span data-site-en="Contact the team" data-site-ta="குழுவைத் தொடர்புகொள்ள">Contact the team</span></a><a href="/privacy-policy.html"><span data-site-en="Privacy &amp; visitor tracking" data-site-ta="தனியுரிமை · வருகைப் புள்ளிவிவரங்கள்">Privacy &amp; visitor tracking</span></a></nav><div class="site-footer-bottom"><span>© <span id="year"></span> Podaturpet.com</span><span class="mr-footer-credit"><img src="/images/muraraj-mr-logo.svg" width="28" height="28" alt="" loading="lazy">Developed &amp; Maintained by <strong>MuraRaj Technologies</strong></span></div></div><!-- PT:shared:footer:END --></footer></div><div id="print-output"></div><script src="/podaturpet-editorial.js?v=20260920-global" defer></script>
