     <section class="hero"><div><div class="eyebrow" lang="en">Real photographed collection</div><h1 lang="en">White checked lungis for wholesale buyers.</h1><p class="lead" lang="en">A clean white foundation, fine intersecting lines and blue-to-grey check variations: explore a photographed lungi style and start a practical sourcing conversation.</p><div class="buttons"><a class="button primary" href="https://wa.me/14793201970?text=Hello%20Podaturpet%20Team%2C%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20white%20checked%20lungis.%20Approximate%20quantity%3A%20____%20Destination%3A%20____%0AReference%3A%20PT-WC-01" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" lang="en">Ask about white checked lungis</a><a class="button" href="/wholesale-lungi-enquiry.html?product=PT-WC-01" lang="en">Complete buyer enquiry</a></div></div><img class="hero-image" src="images/Newphoto1.jpeg" alt="Original photograph of folded white checked lungis with fine blue and grey stripe variations" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="873" height="846" srcset="/images/responsive/Newphoto1-480.webp 480w, /images/responsive/Newphoto1-800.webp 800w, /images/Newphoto1.jpeg 873w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 92vw, (max-width: 1000px) 50vw, 560px"></section>
     <section class="section"><h2 lang="en">What this photographed design shows.</h2><p class="intro" lang="en">The collection photograph shows multiple folded white lungis with narrow and broad checked lines. Pattern spacing and line colour vary between the displayed pieces, giving buyers useful visual references when explaining their preference.</p><div class="cards"><article class="card"><h3 lang="en">White checked appearance</h3><p lang="en">A predominantly white background with understated intersecting blue, grey and darker lines.</p></article><article class="card"><h3 lang="en">More than one pattern</h3><p lang="en">The photographed pieces show different check densities and stripe arrangements. Ask which design can be sourced.</p></article><article class="card"><h3 lang="en">Useful buyer reference</h3><p lang="en">Share the pattern you prefer, together with the quantity and destination, to start a clearer discussion.</p></article></div></section>
     <section class="section"><h2 lang="en">Details to confirm before buying.</h2><p class="intro" lang="en">A photograph is a design reference, not a guarantee of fabric composition, stock or commercial terms. Ask our wholesale team to confirm the specifics that matter to your business.</p><ul class="checklist"><li lang="en">Fabric composition, finish and sample availability.</li><li lang="en">White shade and the exact blue or grey check pattern.</li><li lang="en">Finished dimensions, folding style and packing.</li><li lang="en">Approximate order quantity and current availability.</li><li lang="en">Destination, transport arrangements and delivery terms.</li><li lang="en">Price, business credentials and other commercial terms.</li></ul></section>
